					<DESCRIPTION>Stone coffins stand in rows across this $adj_mustydark vault. </DESCRIPTION>
					<DESCRIPTION>Pillars of stacked skulls hold up the ceiling here. </DESCRIPTION>
					<DESCRIPTION>An altar of yellowed bone dominates this $adj_scary_feeling chamber. </DESCRIPTION>
				</DESCRIPTION>
				<DESCRIPTION select="any-1">
					<DESCRIPTION>Candle stubs ring the floor, long burnt out. </DESCRIPTION>
					<DESCRIPTION>Some of the lids have been pushed aside from within. </DESCRIPTION>
					<DESCRIPTION>Whispers seem to come from the walls. </DESCRIPTION>
